      ":question/problem": "What is the sum of the leading entries of the $2\\text{nd},$ $3\\text{rd},$ and $4\\text{th}$ rows in the matrix $A,$ given below?\n\n$$\nA=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -5 & 9 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 7 & 0 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -7 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$",
